WEBVTT

00:03.800 --> 00:05.500
Your Highness is awake...

00:14.480 --> 00:20.500
Your Highness, I told you before: you might not trust me, but even I didn't know what desperate lengths I might go to.

00:21.280 --> 00:34.000
If I wish to keep resisting my fate, my only choice was to drag Your Highness down to be mad with me this once!

00:34.920 --> 00:37.000
Chen Wan'er! Have you lost your mind?!

00:38.640 --> 00:44.800
Your Highness, as an imperial prince, there was never any path of retreat for you. Wan'er is doing you a service!

00:45.520 --> 00:53.320
The entire Prince of Ning household has been turning the city upside down searching for us all night.

00:53.400 --> 01:01.000
If they discover that on your elder brother's wedding day, you woke up in the bed of your own sister-in-law...

01:01.040 --> 01:07.500
how do you think all under Heaven will look upon you, Prince of Jin?

01:11.000 --> 01:15.500
Your Highness... do you desire to become the master of all under Heaven?

01:17.240 --> 01:20.000
Chen Wan'er, what madness are you scheming?!

01:21.560 --> 01:26.500
The City Gate Commandant is your man; the Xie clan leans firmly in your favor.

01:26.880 --> 01:30.000
As for the Chen clan, leave them to me.

01:30.120 --> 01:36.800
With the wedding festivities underway, guards are lax. Your Highness, if you seal the gates and rally the troops...

01:37.280 --> 01:41.000
from this day forth, YOU are the Emperor!

01:49.480 --> 01:57.500
Or else, you can saunter outside just like this, and let all under Heaven laugh at the disgrace of your royal Sikong house!
